WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.714
Could land be redistributed without

2
00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:05.114
force? Vinoba Bhave tried asking

3
00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:06.167
for it.

4
00:00:06.484 --> 00:00:07.297
In 1951,

5
00:00:07.297 --> 00:00:08.604
at Pochampally,

6
00:00:08.604 --> 00:00:10.477
a landlord gave land to

7
00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.774
the landless at Vinoba Bhave's

8
00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:15.138
request. That began the Bhoodan

9
00:00:15.138 --> 00:00:16.236
movement.

10
00:00:16.579 --> 00:00:17.425
By law,

11
00:00:17.425 --> 00:00:20.124
zamindari was abolished in the

12
00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:21.511
early 1950s.

13
00:00:21.511 --> 00:00:23.759
Tenancy reforms and land ceilings

14
00:00:23.759 --> 00:00:25.517
had mixed results.

15
00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.857
The intermediaries went.

16
00:00:27.857 --> 00:00:29.617
But much of the inequality

17
00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:31.167
in land stayed.

18
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:33.123
Your turn.

19
00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:34.863
Who started it?
